00:58:35.400 --> 00:58:41.520
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our show by Mr. Torey Malatia, who describes listening to our program this way.
<v Ira Glass>我们节目的WBEZ管理监督是托里·马拉蒂亚先生，他这样描述收听我们的节目。

00:58:41.520 --> 00:58:50.440
<v Michael Paterniti>You really, I think, fall into a bit of an existential crisis. Like, what the hell am I doing? I really think I'm going to throw up.
<v Michael Paterniti>你真的，我想，陷入了某种存在主义危机。就像，我到底在做什么？我真的觉得我要呕吐了。

00:58:50.440 --> 00:58:55.280
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周再回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:55.280 --> 00:59:00.280
